{"productId": "bdd4c1cb-bb22-471c-b172-b099fe6074a7", "modelName": "NULA Model 20 Kodiak", "modelDescription": "The Wilson Combat NULA bolt action rifle is an impressive tool for the avid hunter. This rifle features exceptional accuracy and comes with a sub 1\" MOA guarantee. Weighing in at an incredible 4 to 5 pounds, it is also one of the lightest \u2013 perfect for extended hunts where firearm weight is a factor. The NULA bolt action rifle provides an advantage for any hunter due to its lightweight design and extreme accuracy, giving hunters confidence that their shot will be on target every time. The lightweight construction of this rifle makes it easy to maneuver in the field. Whether you\u2019re hunting big game or small varmints, this bolt action rifle provides the accuracy and dependability needed to get your trophy quickly and cleanly. This top-of-the-line rifle boasts many premium features that experienced hunters will appreciate, including a precision Wilson Combat 416R stainless honed and double stress relieved button rifled barrel, a Timney Elite Hunter trigger that offers a smooth 2.75 to 3.25-pound trigger pull, and a receiver fully machined and EDM cut from 4140 bar stock. All are encased in a unique ultra-lightweight carbon fiber stock that includes reinforced receiver walls for added strength without adding weight. For those looking for a lightweight rifle with superior performance, the Wilson Combat New Ultralight Arms is the perfect choice. Join the legacy that has been built through decades of hard work and dedication \u2013 order your New Ultralight Arms bolt rifle today.", "manufacturerName": "Wilson Combat", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "075606db-f737-46fe-85a0-8d4095a61113", "description": "Wilson Combat, NULA Model 20, Bolt Action Rifle, 308 Winchester, 20\" Threaded Barrel, Black Finish, Kodiak Rogue Carbon Fiber Stock, Right Hand, 4 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/Sub